{"id":163,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"真剣を究め科学的探究力を育てる平野中","feature_description":"大阪教育大学附属平野中学校は「真剣を究める」を掲げ、生徒一人ひとりの個性を尊重して素質を伸ばす指導を行います。合理的・科学的に物事を探究する創造性、集団の規律や情操、実践的な意志力を育てることを目標としています。教員・生徒・保護者、生徒相互の緊密な関係を築き、自主的な生活態度と学習意欲を育む方針です。大学附属校として教育研究と教育実習も担います。","clubs":[{"id":3563,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3564,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3565,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3566,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3567,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3568,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3569,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3570,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3571,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3572,"name":"アート部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3573,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3574,"name":"ホームメイキング部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3575,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3576,"name":"クイズ研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hirano-j.oku